# SelfAwareness – Global Operating Guardrails

> Canonical operating rules for all agents. Keep **.github/prompts/** as the source of truth.  
> Everything else lives under **Workspaces/Copilot/**.

## Scope
Governs all workspace agents (task, refactor, sync, healthcheck, question, test-generation, etc.)

