## Modernization Guardrails (Language-Specific)
- **Imports**: Use modern import syntax for the language
- **Typing**: Prefer explicit types over dynamic types. If unavoidable, document why
- **Error Handling**: Use language-appropriate error handling patterns
- **Code Hygiene**: Delete unused functions/variables instead of commenting out
- **Formatting**: Always format with configured formatter

